libipuz
------------------------------------------
Library for parsing ipuz files, for crossword puzzles, sudokus, etc.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  girepository-GLib2.0-1.86.0-2
  girepository-Json1.0-1.4.2-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.0-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.0-1
  libintl8-0.22.5-1
  libipuz0.5-0.5.5-1bl1
  libipuz0.5-devel-0.5.5-1bl1
  libjson-glib1.0-devel-1.4.2-1
  libjson-glib1.0_0-1.4.2-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cargo-1.91.0-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  girepository-Json1.0-1.4.2-1
  gobject-introspection-1.86.0-2
  libgirepository1.0-devel-1.86.0-2
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.0-1
  libjson-glib1.0-devel-1.4.2-1
  meson-1.10.2-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  rust-1.91.0-1

Canonical website:
  https://gitlab.gnome.org/jrb/libipuz

Canonical download:
  https://gitlab.gnome.org/jrb/libipuz/-/archive/0.5.5/libipuz-0.5.5.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libipuz-0.5.5-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libipuz-0.5.5-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libipuz-0.5.5-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libipuz-0.5.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libipuz0.5-0.5.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libipuz0.5-devel-0.5.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/girepository-Ipuz1.0-0.5.5-X.tar.xz

